{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course for the Everwind Demo and set sail for a standalone adventure that sets the tone of the world, and showcases the first moments of the full game\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/da31c4e0a487709c9add7e85a9a0fdae.poster.avif?t=1759154001\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/da31c4e0a487709c9add7e85a9a0fdae.webm?t=1759154001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the First Altitude</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take to the skies and journey across three distinct biomes, each with its own atmosphere, challenges, wildlife and beauty waiting to be uncovered.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/589edf7b4401cf63f9ba71e76ce664bc.poster.avif?t=1759154001\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/589edf7b4401cf63f9ba71e76ce664bc.webm?t=1759154001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>4-Player Co-op Adventure</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play solo or team up with up to three friends and share the thrill of discovering the world of Everwind together!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/3cfd011d15d44f889d88813e0c07b900.poster.avif?t=1759154001\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/3cfd011d15d44f889d88813e0c07b900.webm?t=1759154001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Swords, Magical Staffs &amp; Much More!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wield a variety of weapons\u2014from melee arms to magical staffs and spellbooks\u2014 while experimenting with the features that bring the vast Everwind world to life.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face a Powerful Enemy</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test in an epic boss battle that promises both challenge and reward, leaving you hungry for what lies beyond the clouds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is NOT time-limited, however the amount of gameplay is estimated for approximately 2 hours.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and saves from the demo will not carry over to the Early Access release of the game.</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is just a sample of Everwind's core systems and features presented in a compact, demo friendly scope (eg. limited class availability), with much more depth and content awaiting in the full game.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028270?t=1759154001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/89a102274ce46dbc109260b9fb21f23b432a2d9d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759154001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/702901abc09fae2932c0022a3652c1f0410a41b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759154001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/702901abc09fae2932c0022a3652c1f0410a41b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759154001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course for the Everwind Demo and set sail for a standalone adventure that sets the tone of the world, and showcases the first moments of the full game\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/da31c4e0a487709c9add7e85a9a0fdae.poster.avif?t=1759154001\" width=616 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/extras/da31c4e0a487709c9add7e85a9a0fdae.webm?t=1759154001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore the First Altitude</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cent