verwind world to life.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face a Powerful Enemy</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test in an epic boss battle that promises both challenge and reward, leaving you hungry for what lies beyond the clouds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is NOT time-limited, however the amount of gameplay is estimated for approximately 2 hours.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and saves from the demo will not carry over to the Early Access release of the game.</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is just a sample of Everwind's core systems and features presented in a compact, demo friendly scope (eg. limited class availability), with much more depth and content awaiting in the full game.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Enjoy Studio S.A."],"fullgame":{"appid":"2253100","name":"Everwind"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028270/f997bc990b4fe06fc92241f602507b7d44789b61/header.jpg?t=1759154001","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 BOHEMIA INTERACTIVE a.s.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028270/1799305302/74a3fc82ae4bedade0f4ccdc3aeaf50fae4fe1bd/1759